  "text": "Flushing, swollen and bleeding gums, burning mouth feeling, anxiety. At higher doses, extreme vertigo and dizziness.\nI have been taking this for 9 months.\nThe side effects were worse at first, but now have lessened somewhat.\nI tried to go up tp\n5mg because my BP was still spiking to 150/100 at least once a day, but it caused extreme vertigo and dizziness, so I had to back off.\nNow a few months later, I am trying 5mg again, split up into two doses of 2.5 mg taken 12 hours apart.\nThis seems to make it easier, I have been on the increased divided dose for four days now and so far no vertigo.\nThe side effects are mild enough for me that I am still taking it as of now.\n",
